    "description": "If you're a passionate SEO Specialist with drive and ambition, Dishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services in Nagpur is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Dishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services:\nDishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Execute digital marketing campaigns across Google, Meta, and other channels\n• Coordinate with vendors and suppliers for inventory management\n• Build and maintain affiliate and influencer marketing programs\n• Optimize product pages for search visibility and conversion\n• Collaborate with logistics partners to ensure timely delivery\n• Manage customer reviews, ratings, and return/refund processes\n• Analyze sales data and customer behavior to drive revenue growth\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain\n• Proficiency in Affiliate Marketing\n• Proficiency in SEO/SEM\n• Proficiency in Content Writing\n• Proficiency in Digital Marketing\n• Proficiency in Performance Marketing\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Facebook Ads\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Nagpur, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dishis Designer Jewellery Holdings Services!",
